  a) Dynamic loop print handling - Ensure printf works correctly inside loops with variable bounds
  b) Post-call state access - Fix how array state is accessed after function calls return
  c) Conditional output - Support conditional print statements based on runtime values

  Key areas to investigate:
  - internal/ir/builder.go - SSA building for loop-based prints
  - internal/mlir/emitter.go - MLIR emission for complex control flow + output
  - internal/backend/signed_verilog.go - Verilog generation correctness

