  1. DO NOT simply make the test pass by removing verification output
  2. DO fix the actual compiler bugs preventing correct output
  3. The encrypted/decrypted hex dumps MUST be present and match
  4. Add regression tests for any compiler fixes
  5. Update all generated artifacts (.ssa, .ir, .sv) after fixes are complete
  - No workarounds that reduce verification value
  - Compiler now correctly handles the patterns that were failing

